# ATLAS discovery objects. The public edge sends 4planet.org/atlas/{slug}
# to 4planetatlas.com/{slug} and drops /atlas. These static rules run before
# the SPA shell so the final response is the prerendered /atlas/{slug}/ object.
/earth /atlas/earth/ 308
/earth/ /atlas/earth/ 308
/fires /atlas/fires/ 308
/fires/ /atlas/fires/ 308
/whales /atlas/whales/ 308
/whales/ /atlas/whales/ 308
/api/*  /api/:splat  200
/*  /index.html  200
